        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I book a bike parcel through IRCTC and still use your door‑to‑door service?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Our team integrates with IRCTC bike parcel booking online, handling the railway paperwork while providing doorstep pickup in Uchgaon. We then transfer the bike to our dedicated container fleet for the final leg, ensuring seamless multimodal transport.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for the IBA‑approved bike transport from Uchgaon?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You need a valid government ID, bike registration certificate, GST invoice (if applicable), and a signed insurance declaration. Our staff prepares the e‑Way bill and IBA mover code certificate, so you receive a compliant GST bill for reimbursement claims.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the price for Bike Transportation In Uchgaon calculated?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Pricing is based on the 850 km distance, bike dimensions, selected packaging tier, and insurance coverage. We provide a transparent quote that itemises fuel surcharge, handling fees, and any optional services such as expedited delivery or extra cushioning.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is full transit insurance mandatory for bike shipping, and what does it cover?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Full transit insurance is optional but highly recommended. Our 100 % IRDAI‑approved marine transit policy covers loss, theft, and any accidental damage during the entire journey, giving you peace of mind and a hassle‑free claim process.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What safety measures are taken at the loading dock in Uchgaon?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our trained crew conducts a pre‑loading audit, uses wheel chocks, high‑tensile ratchet lashings, and hydraulic ramps to secure the bike. Each step is recorded on video, and the bike is placed inside a sealed container before departure.</p>
